+### Cloudflare D1 (db only)
+
+**Env vars:**
+
+```
+DB_PROVIDER=d1
+D1_ACCOUNT_ID=<account id>
+D1_DATABASE_ID=<database uuid>
+D1_API_TOKEN=<token with D1 Edit permission>
